00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:37.590
1585 - Settsu Province, Osaka Castle

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:20.100
The One and Only Flower in the World

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:25.570
Seems like Imai Sōkyū is not fit to take up the profession of tea.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:29.990
Looks like Master Soueki is our choice, Brother.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:35.370
He shall become the number one tea master among the heavens and serve the Emperor himself.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.790
But Lord Hidenaga.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.580
His tea of imperfection may be second to none,

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:47.080
but he seems to have overlooked the Daisu way of tea for royalty.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.950
Will the Emperor be able to accept his way of tea?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:57.000
Listen to me, Ishida Jibu.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.290
The way of tea is not paved by imitation.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.280
Why don't you learn the way of tea from Soueki, Mitsunari?

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:13.020
Perhaps that stubborn head of yours may be able to change.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:22.460
Ochacha!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.840
What nice weather we have today, Chief Advisor.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.080
Sasuke!

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:28.830
Yes!?

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.050
Give my regards to Milady One.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.640
Tell her I am not able to make it there again today!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:33.920
Ochacha!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.420
Ochacha! Ochacha!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.510
The Chief Advisor has official business to attend to today.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.720
Please accept my sincerest apologies to Kita no Mandokoro, Milady One.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:55.350
He's probably fooling around with that girl again.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.980
Must be tough for you, Lord Oribe, for having to cover for him every single time.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.960
That is not true at all.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.200
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.670
I'm not mad at you.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.000
Milady One.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.880
Lord Kato Kiyomasa.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.440
We have not met since our assault on Chōsokabe in Shikoku.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:21.450
That's right.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.610
I brought something good.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:28.430
Ever since I became the Chief Tax Collector,

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.630
I have not had the chance to present a gift.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.610
What a brilliant Tsujigahana dye!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.680
The fabric itself is quite magnificent, too...

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.830
That's right.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:49.340
You see, tigers lick their own fur to keep themselves clean.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:55.050
So you're saying that a rise in rank warrants close attention to etiquette, right?

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:55.940
That's right.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:05:00.160
You've always loved talking about tigers.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.610
Perhaps something went wrong with your upbringing?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.570
I don't think I am fit to wear something this gorgerous.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.370
I think I like wearing clothes which I don't mind if dirtied.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.410
Oh?

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.690
If you aren't wearing that...

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:17.280
I yearn for it.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.180
Collecting this is not my cup of tea,

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.200
but if Osen wears it...

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:30.730
It'll be like a brilliant lone flower blossoming in the midst of madness.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.730
That's right.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:36.980
But this is a gift from Lord Kiyomasa.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:42.030
I cannot bear the embarrassment of naming a price.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.370
I shall take my leave then.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.350
Lord Oribe.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:52.390
If you want this, then just take it.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.980
You can't hide what's so clearly written on your face.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:01.860
That's right.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.400
Come on. Get over here, you monkey.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:30.900
So this is what it means for Ochacha to invite someone?

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:34.320
I am Oda's daughter, of the heavens.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.130
I can't stand this peaceful life anymore.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:45.030
"Tread yourself lightly. Know your place." I am tired of Nagamasu's yapping!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.080
If I can become the Chief Advisor's woman,

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.820
nothing can get in my way anymore.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:03.060
Seems like you are much different from your real father Asai or your guardian Shibata.

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.310
You inherited the fierceness of Oda.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:07.620
I like that feistiness.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:11.550
But you lack any sex appeal.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:20.350
Drink up.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.100
Once a man has gambled too far...

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.740
he cannot even find a place to stand.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.190
I've gone in too deep.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:35.370
This huge gamble of taking over the heavens...

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.610
I can't stand that face of yours, either.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:50.700
It reminds me of the late Lord Nobunaga.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.170
How does it feel?

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.490
Is it working?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.280
Lust!

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.020
Without lust you cannot get what you want!

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:42.550
I am a man of fine tastes.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:45.530
During my early travels,

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.120
I've mastered the art of this quite well.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.370
It's here!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.460
Three years since my last!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.440
All right!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:33.350
I shall make the world beautiful, as you wish!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.170
Good!

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:50.150
Tsujigahana fits you quite well!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.370
It'll be even better once we get that fitted, Osen.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.490
Wearing such magnificent clothes...

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:02.720
Somehow I feel unease for the future.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.140
I understand.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:10.070
But a destitute flower atop an unadorned bed is quite boring.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.200
That's what the legend down here believes.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:32.330
Ever since our daughter Sen got married, I have been feeling lonely.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.890
1585 - Inside Osaka Castle, Yamazatomaru Park

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:51.980
I said I wanted to see the blossoming morning glories!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.410
Who stripped them all off?

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.350
Only one left and hung on the wall!?

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:12.320
Thank you very much for taking time out of your busy schedule.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.840
Amazing!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:21.200
The sight of hundreds of morning glories blossoming is a sort of murky beauty.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:23.520
But the sight of a single flower on the wall

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:29.020
emphasizes the shape, the color, the contours, and the beauty of the morning glory itself.

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:31.030
Thank you for the compliments.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.880
I wanted to see hundreds of them blossoming!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:39.280
You went too far!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:46.140
It was decided from the start that you are the tea master,

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.700
but you omitted the Daisu tea way during the ceremony.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.100
Imai spilled the hot water thanks to your good luck.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.600
That's how everyone acknowledged you.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:03.180
If I may interject, I believe I used the best assortment of tools possible.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:11.370
I hope you will follow my way when you perform the ceremony for the Imperial household.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.370
I don't care that much about your way of the ceremony,

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:23.770
but in order to assist me in the Imperial household, you will need a higher rank.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.760
I understand.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.790
I have asked the chief priest of Daitoku-ji,

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:32.840
Kokei Souchin, to assign you a good name.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.550
The official order will come later.

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:44.360
You name shall henceforth be changed from Senno Soueki to Sen no Rikyū.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:55.810
"Rikyū" is the land of zen achieved only after intensive and cruel training.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:02.400
I am shivering with joy at being chosen such a marvelous name.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.970
Have you finished your golden tea room?

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.500
I have gathered the golden tools.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.630
I need one more thing.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.420
I imported this from the faraway lands.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.310
Stir this into the tea,

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:32.100
and one is able to ease their way into the afterlife.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:39.190
Are you implying...

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.300
You will put poison in the tea...

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.920
And have the Emperor drink it...

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:48.260
Both you and the Emperor are blossoming flowers in this world.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:54.510
But there is no need for many flowers to blossom all at once. Just one is sufficient.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:04.390
The Chief Advisor residing in Osaka Castle should be the only flower in the world.

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:08.820
Being the only one emphasizes its own individual beauty.

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:13.370
If the Emperor becomes that single blossoming flower, then the citizens will feel worried.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:21.870
Once the Emperor falls, you can have the entire citizenry in your grasp.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:30.710
You can then restrict the right to bear arms to only the samurai class and enact land surveys across the nation.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.440
Please surpass Lord Nobunaga.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:48.050
As of now, you are unable to surpass mere imitation.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:02.940
Brother! Brother!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:08.170
I will not act as your tool for murder!

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:42.910
As expected of the Chief Advisor Hideyoshi.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.000
You had the strength to stab me, Rikyū.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:51.120
There is nothing in the world that you cannot accomplish.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:15:59.990
Allow me.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:08.410
I shall serve you earnestly for the rest of my life.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.980
January, 1586 - Kyo, Imperial Palace Court Room

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:43.690
Please excuse me for such a clumsy act in front of my Emperor...

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:49.340
Do not be hasty and properly add the tea leaves.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:56.330
Fujiwara, renamed Toyotomi.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:59.300
The Imperial Court has a high opinion of you.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.150
I am quite content, myself.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:08.380
You have finally become one of us.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:30.510
Please excuse me again. Someone, bring me new tea.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:45.010
Counting last October and this ceremony,

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:48.200
you have missed two chances.

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:55.590
The Chief Advisor is such a kind man.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.500
Your sincerity amazes me yet again.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.510
February, 1586 - Settsu Province, Inside Osaka Castle

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:19.590
I, Furuta Oribe, am here.

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:20.820
Come in.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:38.700
Amazed? I, Araki Doufun, have amassed this collection.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:44.220
I never thought I'd invite that grunt soldier over for a tea ceremony.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:55.000
I have graduated from such gilded luxury goods.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:59.200
But I am floored by the brilliance of these famed objects.

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:05.310
I do not see the famous Jar of the Warrior.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.370
Look how much pain I'm in!
You're worried about mere tea pots!?

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.020
Oh! Are you all right?

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.970
Too late to backpedal!

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:17.950
The Chief Advisor bought it for a high price.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.430
To a combat-tested veteran like me,

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:25.120
that money is enough for me to enjoy the rest of my days.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.680
Until your death?

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:42.160
I am sick. My days are numbered.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:49.680
Seems like what you've done as a warrior has come back to bite you.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.970
You have no right to lecture me!

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:56.340
I am prepared to go to hell.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.000
But something still nags my heart.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:04.450
Seems like a son of mine still lives.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.350
When Nobunaga had my entire clan massacred, 

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:11.050
a wet nurse escaped with a child.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.750
I have a request.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:21.870
I can only ask a fellow aesthete.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:29.560
If you ever meet my son, please tell him my story.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:35.430
Tell him the truth. Tell him how I survived in these turbulent times.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:47.550
I won't ask you to do that for free. Choose something you like.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:55.820
I don't need anything. As a fellow warrior, I will carry out your request.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.020
Thank you very much.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:00.930
No, I just can't bear the thought of taking something.

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.780
Enough. Just take something.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.660
This, then.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:12.580
That is a high class ritual tea stand from Korea, the only one of its kind here in Japan!

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.690
This cross-shaped impression is quite nice.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.840
As is this ripe loquat glaze!

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:24.500
As soon as I saw this, my heart went fluttering!

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:29.600
You can't have this!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.880
No take backs!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:37.640
Shut up! I'm taking this to the grave!

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:40.600
You said I could take anything I want!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.020
This is an exception!

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:06.830
You told me to tell nothing but the truth, did you not?

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:22.020
Keep it real. We humans take greed to our graves.

00:22:49.520 --> 00:22:56.540
What is this feeling of freshness in my heart?

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:06.320
Everytime I　

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:06.320
Anata no mune

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.710
feel your heart

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.710
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:14.800
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:14.800
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:20.980
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:20.980
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.140
Opppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.140
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:33.230
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:33.230
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.230 --> 00:23:37.110
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.230 --> 00:23:37.110
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:40.690
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:40.690
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:46.560
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:46.560
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:49.560
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:49.560
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:52.170
Without each other.

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:52.170
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:53.130
You should

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:53.130
Soshite

00:23:53.220 --> 00:23:58.630
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.220 --> 00:23:58.630
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:02.420
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:02.420
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:08.130
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:08.130
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:14.620
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:14.620
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:20.420
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:20.420
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:26.400
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:26.400
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.160 --> 00:24:36.700
"Bang!"

00:24:41.810 --> 00:24:42.960
"Bang! Bang!"

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:50.250
"Rikyū has grown too big."

00:24:50.650 --> 00:24:52.910
Woman from Nagoya.

00:24:53.370 --> 00:24:58.320
To be a warrior or an aestete? That is the question.

00:24:56.240 --> 00:24:59.660
Woman from Nagoya
